1
00:00:00,126 --> 00:00:04,086
...we imply that we will be
the crushers of Wesley.

2
00:00:05,507 --> 00:00:07,467
I'm sorry, but the Wesley Crushers...

3
00:00:07,634 --> 00:00:09,924
...sounds like people
who like Wesley Crusher.

4
00:00:10,136 --> 00:00:12,176
No, again,
it's not the Wesley Crushers.

5
00:00:12,347 --> 00:00:14,517
It's the Wesley "Crushers."

6
00:00:16,434 --> 00:00:19,394
No, if you want it to mean
you're crushing Wesley...

7
00:00:19,563 --> 00:00:21,523
...it'd be the "Wesley" Crushers.

8
00:00:21,731 --> 00:00:24,821
(Sheldon:)Do you people even hear yourselves?
It's not the Wesley Crushers.

9
00:00:24,985 --> 00:00:29,025
It's not the "Wesley" Crushers,
it's Wesley "Crushers."

10
00:00:29,197 --> 00:00:31,737
(Wil:)Hey, look.
They named their team after me.

11
00:00:33,159 --> 00:00:35,949
No, it's not-- Never mind.

12
00:00:38,415 --> 00:00:41,755
(Stuart:)So we're all clear on the bet
and the stakes?

13
00:00:41,918 --> 00:00:42,998
(Sheldon:)Oh, yes.

14
00:00:43,169 --> 00:00:47,339
(Sheldon:)The losers will be publicly humiliated
in a fashion to be chosen by the victor.

15
00:00:47,549 --> 00:00:51,259
(Sheldon:)FYI, I plan on having you
publish a scientific paper...

16
00:00:51,428 --> 00:00:54,638
(Sheldon:)...expounding the discredited
Belakovsky hypotheses.

17
00:00:56,474 --> 00:01:00,024
(Stuart:)Ouch again.

